# BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to a context-root
# .dockerignore, which lets this project keep its build configuration to itself even
# though the build context is the parent directory.
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/build
**/dist
**/data
**/gx
**/logs
